---
layout: base.njk
title: "DHS Multispecialty Hospital, Ahmedabad — NABH Hospital"
description: "NABH-accredited multispecialty hospital in Ahmedabad. 15+ specialties, 24/7 emergency & ICU, 100,000+ patients treated. Book appointment today."
keywords: "multispecialty hospital Ahmedabad, NABH hospital Ahmedabad, orthopedic hospital Ahmedabad, knee replacement Ahmedabad, DHS Hospital, emergency hospital Gurukul Ahmedabad"
canonical: "https://www.dhshospitals.com/"
og_title: "DHS Multispecialty Hospital, Ahmedabad — NABH Hospital"
og_description: "NABH-accredited multispecialty hospital in Ahmedabad. 15+ specialties, 24/7 emergency & ICU, 100,000+ patients treated."
activePage: "home"
extra_head: true
preload_hero: true
---

<section class="hero velys-led-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-eyebrow">NEW IN AHMEDABAD &nbsp;·&nbsp; VELYS Robotic-Assisted Solution</div>
      <h1>Robotic Knee Replacement at DHS Hospital, Ahmedabad</h1>
      <p>VELYS robotic-assisted knee replacement from <strong>Johnson &amp; Johnson DePuy Synthes</strong> &mdash; an imageless platform with <strong>no pre-op CT</strong>, sub-millimetre accuracy, and the proven J&amp;J Attune knee implant. Led by Dr. Hardik Shah (FRCS Germany) and Dr. Swagat Shah (FIAAS UK).</p>

      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div><strong>Imageless</strong><span>no pre-op CT</span></div>
        <div><strong>2,000+</strong><span>knee replacements</span></div>
        <div><strong>Senior</strong><span>orthopedic team</span></div>
        <div><strong>Cashless</strong><span>insurance available</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-buttons">
        <a href="/velys-robotic-knee-replacement-ahmedabad/" class="btn btn-accent">Learn About VELYS</a>
        <a href="/appointment/" class="btn btn-outline" style="border-color:#fff;color:#fff">Book Consultation</a>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-anchor">
        At <strong>DHS Multispecialty Hospital</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; NABH-accredited &nbsp;·&nbsp; 15+ specialties &nbsp;·&nbsp; 24/7 emergency &nbsp;·&nbsp;
        <a href="/departments/">explore all departments</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
.velys-led-hero .hero-content{max-width:720px}
.hero-eyebrow{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:5px 14px;border-radius:14px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.6px;margin-bottom:18px}
.velys-led-hero h1{font-size:2.6rem;line-height:1.18;margin-bottom:16px}
.velys-led-hero .hero-content>p{font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:18px;opacity:.95}
.hero-stats{display:flex;gap:26px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:8px 0 22px;padding:14px 18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);border-radius:8px}
.hero-stats>div{min-width:108px}
.hero-stats strong{display:block;font-size:1.4rem;line-height:1.1;color:#fff;font-weight:700}
.hero-stats span{display:block;font-size:.78rem;opacity:.85;margin-top:2px}
.hero-anchor{margin-top:22px;font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.7;opacity:.85;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}
.hero-anchor a{color:#fff;text-decoration:underline}
.hero-anchor a:hover{opacity:1;color:#fff}
@media(max-width:768px){.velys-led-hero h1{font-size:1.9rem}.hero-stats{gap:18px;padding:12px 14px}.hero-stats strong{font-size:1.2rem}}
</style>

<section class="stats-bar">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="stats-grid">
      {% for stat in site.stats %}
      <div class="stat-item">
        <div class="stat-value">{{ stat.value }}</div>
        <div class="stat-label">{{ stat.label }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<a href="{{ site.google_reviews_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="google-trust-strip">
  <span class="gts-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span>
  <span class="gts-rating"><strong>4.9</strong> Rating</span>
  <span class="gts-sep">&middot;</span>
  <span class="gts-count">2,000+ Google Reviews</span>
  <span class="gts-sep">&middot;</span>
  <span class="gts-cta">View on Google &rarr;</span>
</a>

<section class="section robotic-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="welcome" style="text-align:center;color:var(--accent-gold);font-weight:600;font-size:.85rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.2px;margin-bottom:6px">Robotic Joint Replacement</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Ahmedabad's Advanced Robotic Knee &amp; Hip Replacement Programme</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">DHS Multispecialty Hospital uses the VELYS Robotic-Assisted Solution from Johnson &amp; Johnson DePuy Synthes — an imageless robotic platform paired with the proven J&amp;J Attune knee implant.</p>

    <div class="robotic-grid">
      <div class="robotic-card">
        <div class="robotic-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#9881;</div>
        <h3>VELYS Robotic Knee Replacement</h3>
        <p>Total and partial knee replacement with sub-millimetre robotic accuracy. No pre-op CT scan, strong alignment accuracy compared with manual technique, faster recovery.</p>
        <a href="/velys-robotic-knee-replacement-ahmedabad/" class="robotic-link">VELYS deep dive &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="robotic-card">
        <div class="robotic-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#127973;</div>
        <h3>Knee Replacement in Ahmedabad</h3>
        <p>Total, partial, and revision knee replacement — robotic and conventional options, cashless insurance, transparent estimates.</p>
        <a href="/knee-replacement-ahmedabad/" class="robotic-link">Explore knee replacement &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="robotic-card">
        <div class="robotic-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#129489;&#8205;&#9877;&#65039;</div>
        <h3>Led by Senior Orthopedic Surgeons</h3>
        <p>Dr. Hardik M Shah (FRCS Germany) and Dr. Swagat M Shah (FIAAS UK) lead a senior orthopedic team that has performed 2,000+ knee replacement surgeries (robotic and conventional) with high patient satisfaction.</p>
        <a href="/doctors/" class="robotic-link">Meet our surgeons &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="robotic-cta">
      <a href="/appointment/" class="btn btn-accent">Book Robotic Surgery Consultation</a>
      <a href="tel:{{ site.phones.emergency }}" class="btn btn-outline">Call {{ site.phones.emergency }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
.robotic-section{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 0%,var(--primary-light) 100%)}
.robotic-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;margin-top:30px}
.robotic-card{background:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:28px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);border-top:4px solid var(--primary);transition:transform .3s}
.robotic-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}
.robotic-icon{font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1}
.robotic-card h3{color:var(--primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:10px}
.robotic-card p{color:var(--text-light);font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:14px}
.robotic-link{color:var(--primary);font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem}
.robotic-link:hover{color:var(--primary-dark)}
.robotic-cta{display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px}
@media(max-width:960px){.robotic-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-section">
      <div class="about-image">
        <img src="/assets/images/about/dhs-about.jpg" alt="DHS Multispecialty Hospital Ahmedabad" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400">
      </div>
      <div class="about-text">
        <div class="welcome">WELCOME TO</div>
        <h2>DHS Multispecialty Hospital</h2>
        <p>Welcome to DHS Multispecialty Hospital, your trusted hospital partner in Ahmedabad. DHS Multispecialty Hospital is a state-of-the-art advanced multispecialty hospital located in Vastrapur. DHS is a one-stop solution for secondary and tertiary care providing medical and surgical treatments with fully equipped 50 beds, 24x7 ICU & Emergency services.</p>
        <p>After 5+ years of providing comprehensive medical services, DHS hospital proudly stands out for its cutting-edge infrastructure and personalised treatment. Having treated 25,000+ indoor and 100,000+ outdoor patients, we have carved a niche among hospitals in Ahmedabad.</p>
        <p>DHS is a leading centre for <strong>robotic-assisted joint replacement</strong> in Ahmedabad — offering VELYS robotic knee replacement from Johnson &amp; Johnson DePuy Synthes, led by Dr. Hardik M Shah and Dr. Swagat M Shah.</p>
        <p>DHS Multispecialty Hospital offers Mediclaim & Cashless services from major insurance companies for patient's ease.</p>
        <div class="nabh-badge">NABH Accredited Hospital</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="background:var(--bg-light)">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Hospital Facilities</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Apart from clinical departments, DHS Multispecialty Hospital has many critical and crucial supportive facilities ensuring prompt and quality patient care.</p>
    <div class="facilities-grid">
      {% for facility in facilities %}
      <div class="facility-card">
        <img src="{{ facility.icon }}" alt="{{ facility.name }} at DHS Hospital Ahmedabad" loading="lazy" width="50" height="50">
        <h3>{{ facility.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ facility.description }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Our Departments</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Our hospital is accredited by NABH, reflecting our dedication to quality, safety, and continuous improvement.</p>
    <div class="dept-grid">
      {% for dept in departments | head(8) %}
      <div class="dept-card">
        <img src="{{ dept.image }}" alt="{{ dept.name }} department at DHS Hospital Ahmedabad" loading="lazy" width="300" height="180">
        <div class="dept-card-body">
          <h3>{{ dept.name }}</h3>
          <p>{{ dept.short_desc }}</p>
          <a href="/departments/{{ dept.slug }}/" class="btn btn-outline" style="font-size:.8rem;padding:6px 16px">Learn about {{ dept.name }} &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:30px">
      <a href="/departments/" class="btn btn-primary">View All Departments</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="background:var(--bg-light)">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Our Doctors</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Meet our team of experienced and dedicated medical professionals.</p>
    <div class="doctors-grid">
      {% for doc in doctors | head(4) %}
      <div class="doctor-card">
        <img src="{{ doc.image }}" alt="{{ doc.name }} — {{ doc.specialty }} at DHS Hospital Ahmedabad" loading="lazy" width="300" height="250">
        <div class="doctor-card-body">
          <h3>{{ doc.name }}</h3>
          <div class="qualification">{{ doc.qualification }}</div>
          <div class="specialty">{{ doc.specialty }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:30px">
      <a href="/doctors/" class="btn btn-primary">View All Doctors</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section reviews-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Patient Testimonials</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">What our patients say about their experience at DHS Multispecialty Hospital.</p>
    <div class="reviews-grid">
      {% for review in reviews %}
      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
        <p>"{{ review.text }}"</p>
        <div class="source">— {{ review.source }} Review</div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <a href="{{ site.google_reviews_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="google-review-badge">
      <div class="grb-logo">G</div>
      <div class="grb-info">
        <div class="grb-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; <strong>4.9</strong></div>
        <div class="grb-text">Based on 2,000+ Google Reviews</div>
      </div>
      <div class="grb-cta">View Reviews &rarr;</div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section faq-section" style="background:var(--bg-light)">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Find answers to common questions about DHS Multispecialty Hospital.</p>
    {% for section in faq %}
    <h3 class="faq-category">{{ section.category }}</h3>
    {% for item in section.items %}
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>{{ item.q }}</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">{{ item.a }}</div>
    </details>
    {% endfor %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="background:var(--primary);color:#fff;text-align:center">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 style="color:#fff;margin-bottom:15px">Need Medical Assistance?</h2>
    <p style="opacity:.9;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 25px">Our team of expert doctors is available 24/7 for emergencies. Book an appointment or call us now.</p>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:15px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <a href="/appointment/" class="btn btn-accent">Book Appointment</a>
      <a href="tel:{{ site.phones.emergency }}" class="btn" style="background:#fff;color:var(--primary)">Call: {{ site.phones.emergency }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
